       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Sertraline 1000 mg once daily is 5 times the usual maximum adult dose, so I'd like you to check it first.\n\n- **Usual adult dosing:** start at 25\u201350 mg once daily and go up as needed. The maximum is **200 mg/day**.\n- **Likely intended dose:** 1000 mg looks like an extra zero was added, and **100 mg** was probably meant. 50 mg is also a common starting dose.\n- **Risk at 1000 mg/day:** a high chance of serotonin syndrome, QT prolongation and other toxicity.\n\nPlease tell me which you'd like:\n1. **Sertraline 100 mg by mouth once daily** (or 50 mg, or another dose up to 200 mg), or\n2. **Sertraline 1000 mg as written.** I'd only do this if it's truly intended, and I'd add a note with the clinical reason and who confirmed it.\n\nAs soon as you confirm, I'll enter the order."
      }
